//! Address equations of the D, _T and _X GFX10 swizzle modes and of
//! `SW_64KB_Z_X` / `SW_64KB_R_X` (non-RB+, 16-pipe part), one entry per
//! (mode, element bytes): for byte-address bits 0..15 of a block, the X,
//! Y and slice coordinate bits XORed into it. The slice bits are the pipe /
//! bank XOR of the `_X` modes: the array layer (or depth slice) of the
//! element. Generated from the addrlib GFX10 pattern tables.
//!
//! [`THICK_EQUATIONS`] are the 3D ("thick") standard swizzles, whose blocks
//! span several depth slices: there the slice mask selects bits of the
//! depth coordinate inside the block.

/// (mode, bytes per element, [(x mask, y mask, slice mask); 16])
